<figcaption class="ltx_caption">Adjacency tensor <math id="S2.F2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{\mathsfit{A}}}_{\pi^{\dagger},\pi^{\dagger}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝑨</mi><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mo>†</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mo>†</mo></msup></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{\mathsfit{A}}}_{\pi^{\dagger},\pi^{\dagger}}</annotation></semantics></math> where <math id="S2.F2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi^{\dagger}(1,2,3,4,5)=(3,4,1,2,5)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mo>†</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi^{\dagger}(1,2,3,4,5)=(3,4,1,2,5)</annotation></semantics></math> (elementwise): the top-left <math id="S2.F2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3\times 3\times 2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3\times 3\times 2</annotation></semantics></math> subtensor is passed to <math id="S2.F2.m4" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathstrut\mkern 2.5muf\mkern-11.0mu\raise 6.88889pt\hbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\rightharpoonup$}^{(3)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mpadded style="width:0.265em;" width="0.265em"><mi>f</mi></mpadded><mpadded voffset="6.9pt"><mo mathsize="0.500em" stretchy="false">⇀</mo></mpadded><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathstrut\mkern 2.5muf\mkern-11.0mu\raise 6.88889pt\hbox{$\scriptscriptstyle\rightharpoonup$}^{(3)}</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
